# Cross-dict MethodDispatcher chain: inner dict's wildcard chains to outer dict's dispatcher.
[
  TypeA: [type TypeA]
  [instance Addable [let a@TypeA b@TypeA c]: [+: [fn [let x y] 10]]]
  inner: [
    TypeB: [type TypeB]
    [instance Addable [let a@TypeB b@TypeB c]: [+: [fn [let x y] 20]]]
    ra: [+ TypeA.TypeA TypeA.TypeA]
    rb: [+ TypeB.TypeB TypeB.TypeB]
    ri: [+ 1 2]
  ]
]
=== out
Dict({"TypeA": Dict({"TypeA": Variant(TypeA.TypeA, Null)}), "inner": Dict({"TypeB": Dict({"TypeB": Variant(TypeB.TypeB, Null)}), "ra": Int(10), "rb": Int(20), "ri": Int(3)})})
